status GREEN -- front_door_claim witness green on metal, control 15 legs fail=0; the two reds of the cold pass closed on metal, prose_register 18/0/1 and shim_reason 948 at its ceiling; cards A 90 / B 83 / B 81; cold pass tree_moved=no, hot pass named in the send
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the key is opt-in, so this guard hears only the pages that choose to promise. Whether a reading should infer the claim from prose instead, and so reach the pages that never declared one, is a ruling about what a page may assert rather than a lap.
